#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/ValueParsing.cpp (lines 4930-5333): parse_calculated_value,
#       parse_a_calc_function_node, the conversion of a CalcParsing tree into calculation nodes,
#       "parse a calculation" (css-values-4), sibling-count()/sibling-index() and <if-condition>
